# Files that must never be uploaded to Vercel.
#
# Applied relative to the Vercel "Root Directory" (chapter_10_RAG_Basics). The two most important
# entries are the confidential PDF and the secrets file: neither should leave this machine, and the
# vector store directory is regenerated per environment.
#
# Note: for Git deployments the strongest guarantee is that these files are also in .gitignore, so
# they are never committed in the first place.

# --- never leave this machine ------------------------------------------------
*.pdf
.env
.env.local

# --- environment-specific data ----------------------------------------------
.chroma/
chroma_db/
.vercel/

# --- rebuildable / regenerated ----------------------------------------------
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
web/node_modules/
web/dist/

# --- local-only tooling and docs --------------------------------------------
scripts/
plan.md
*.log
